  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10d2d8102cae35c2185a49d6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "哪怕，此行意味着\n要与这个世界宣告永别，\n我也一定会，去完成我的使命。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e71fe475ab269407937a3deea9c01f0ee3e1f676823fc78099ccc4344eae54dc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136200.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        20,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/20/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e51e4ab1f0b9ed1d622d842f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "红色梦想",
      "source_fingerprint": "405c5a0b0ebadc3e73aa5cd38d97e1245d0918e4d04ce079a699041f7ad83372",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136200.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        21,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/21/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ecc19d1700fe92634e45ff70",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "呵呵。正因为有了您的倾力奉献，\n才有了这个大放异彩的舞台――\n我一定会把那份光芒，亲手摘取回来的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e7aea774242972f00231f4baa7b68201bdfc018eef3daf00b3f51ba5ce14fa80",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136200.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        21,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/21/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c485439f8264f8bcaaa2a2af",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "旨在异世界、奋力奔驰的圣女。\n――好想更深地去了解，那份愿望的真面目。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e6390f1a398acba86c0b8b784a22bea1839a34ba720cb7c32e951d90ac00390e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136200.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        22,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/22/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f91530cc826142634a97c91",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "又或者说……当这场比赛宣告结束时，\n她是不是就已经踏上前往异世界的旅程了呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7199e78c3dcad00709103c949a00519a086124a83fdbff5e189baad0362bef23",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136200.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        23,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/23/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8317a49bd4e85627bbde45ea",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "红色梦想最初的考验，\n现在，拉开了帷幕――",
      "source_fingerprint": "5025c808cfa879143b98dfb0747d35a3c227cb35561261e2de65fe56588a8be8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136200.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        24,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/24/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c18aa05173d07e84dd57089a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她的身上散发着一种不同寻常的气氛。\n看来似乎没有必要去担心她。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae949bf8197d16ba016ea540c83bccdce95c62b54285cef21d8e801492695113",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136200.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f874aa56a3afc82587b18a1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "红色梦想",
      "source_fingerprint": "405c5a0b0ebadc3e73aa5cd38d97e1245d0918e4d04ce079a699041f7ad83372",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136200.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c98f7abc03f330a842773404",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员，终于要开始了呢。\n降生于这个世界，已历经几度星霜――",
      "source_fingerprint": "38ea21e88bf680471bf364b9004847bdb3e1d6c50fab0f78e824edc85a7a6908",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136200.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d8e69f1264d97e7b77f12fca",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "红色梦想",
      "source_fingerprint": "405c5a0b0ebadc3e73aa5cd38d97e1245d0918e4d04ce079a699041f7ad83372",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136200.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        5,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/5/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1937079ce723d4af17b3e761",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "终于，迈向异世界的伟大第一步\n踏出的时刻已经到来了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5bff29a467a1c672e1072eca704188788dbca12d27c1b2f93ca0b3259557853",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136200.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        5,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/5/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f9f05834d90ca113295aa6c0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "今天，就要去异世界……是这个意思吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e176616bb11da8931f2c31fa59aab5be5352df62aeaca8a85fb9c5f74ebbc74",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136200.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        6,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/6/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ba68a68c997c39ed1315741",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "红色梦想",
      "source_fingerprint": "405c5a0b0ebadc3e73aa5cd38d97e1245d0918e4d04ce079a699041f7ad83372",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136200.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        6,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/6/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c4c2d2596c15b06e7649cfa",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "只要在这场比赛中获得绝顶的光芒……\n我所应当穿过的那扇大门，就一定会开启吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3495b189b8ee82a11830ca04d30a24c45133e61402e8cbdd10f2107ce73f2c7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136200.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        6,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/6/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:698c3135b56369db24e86bb6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "红色梦想",
      "source_fingerprint": "405c5a0b0ebadc3e73aa5cd38d97e1245d0918e4d04ce079a699041f7ad83372",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136200.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        7,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/7/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f301e1e7f3f40cd29d0d74de",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "如果能够获得完美无瑕的光芒\n――或许就会如此。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9395576e516460dc3e3be5b6bea4e1336010cbed281f1f4368d1084fd278a60a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136200.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        7,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/7/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08a5068a27fe5a2561f8d967",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她所说的『异世界』是否真的存在……\n说实话，自己现在也还无从得知。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b85e78f75b72a9a6167db359d3a09c7ba10535c9de016c27635126e898793f4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136200.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        8,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/8/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a22b00fbd8258e523b668019",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但不可否认的是，对她而言，那是动摇不得的真相，\n也是无可替代的梦想。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b70b6548e7566db4bd740739eb8c2c5ffce2e60b4fb772a7990c1dce725ff533",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136200.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        9,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/9/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0155f85e5722b0f31eb67e94",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "面向出道战",
      "source_fingerprint": "b238f3d3774a08a5d24cc2a7fbf77f459768ea692c436932599218dbd5802721",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136200.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:532dbf5948735ce258dada20",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "旁白",
      "source_fingerprint": "101f6e6d6095ef5e9c57dc2f71e38d0f4d62423cc5fa4d0b069ac78434020272",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136201.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d327b4a92587e5d1087b3784",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "寒意渐浓的12月。\n阪神赛场，正被巨大且热烈的气氛所包围。",
      "source_fingerprint": "09f86d202968eece6a00a99c07f83343a8f9031dc9a936c4227b910479d53bac",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136201.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a1e0584a79439912e1693527",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "观众们",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb9eb6518e94670473e15bc84b7c6dc3f58687c51fb543b0e89b34018813d2d9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136201.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd40f0e138b872cec777022a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『景致——！ 期待你哦——！』\n『是景致的话绝对能赢的！ 加油啊——！』",
      "source_fingerprint": "60506a03b1d9dc1c2d0b5fd7d3ce0ca8ea5be0790e601b66c97b72f2b3923e14",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136201.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f64fffa3cb7ecde620c9891a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迷人景致",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d00a4803d17b32d08d3d9ae9844b52810f0b4162c25dd8d8a1226ea163081d6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136201.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        10,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/10/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b27bc02edc69c0ce0572e3e8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "嗯，我也是哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b1d28a0692f37874a037f5e33e013dff9cda4484663bda098244fdfb8f931920",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136201.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        10,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/10/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2636baa4fa16b9a08fd167e6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "红色梦想",
      "source_fingerprint": "405c5a0b0ebadc3e73aa5cd38d97e1245d0918e4d04ce079a699041f7ad83372",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136201.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        11,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/11/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:331daaacb0bbd0cafc912d9d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "您是将这个世界的爱集于一身、\n耀眼夺目的主角……。\n任何一个人，都不会怀疑您的荣光吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ed3023f861f184fc8f1c90f10f3bb18cfb51a5ce9c8b1534d1ea3c46f37841c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136201.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        11,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/11/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:65ac33438ed0f28f399ab59a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "红色梦想",
      "source_fingerprint": "405c5a0b0ebadc3e73aa5cd38d97e1245d0918e4d04ce079a699041f7ad83372",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136201.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        12,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/12/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c5770effddee476d9f9b56c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "——但是。\n今天，在这一方土地上您将迎来的，\n并不是命中注定的胜利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "be1dff21cb8f7f9263065b47e228437449eadaa2256b48a971a02d7b5d9d6617",
